==Battleground==
*30 [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*30 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very similar to Into the Future's [[NASA (Into the Future)|Nasa]], becoming very easy with anti alien treasures.

Use strong Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] to take care of the Shadow Boxer K, and Alien/Floating crowd-controllers or Long Range Attackers for the I.M. Phace. It is recommended to use 3-4 meatshields.

